    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-στέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deck with garlands, crown, wreath</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. βωμόν</span> (with branches wreathed in
			wool) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				124
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. νεκρόν</span> (with libations)
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1632
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκαμος ὅδε
			καταστέφειν</span> here are my tresses for you <i>to
			crown</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IA</u>
				1478
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντομαί σε καὶ κ. χεροῖν</span>
			<i>encircle</i> thee, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				226
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέστεψας πέδον</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάστεψον π.</span> are vv. ll. in
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				467
			</span></i>, cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστείβω; κ. τὰς πρῴρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					51.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρεα</span> Epic. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				7p.7
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεστέφθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.164
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάφνῃ κατεστεμμένος τὰς κόμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.34
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλάδος ἐρίῳ κατεστ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				18
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδία ληΐοις
				κατεστεμμένα</span> Men.Rh.<i><span class="en">
				p.345
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πόλος ἀστέρας κατέστεπται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
